\title{scdbayes: Bayesian Single-Case Design Analysis}
\description{
\if{html}{\figure{logo.png}{options: style='float: right' alt='logo' width='120'}}

Provides a Bayesian multilevel modeling workflow for single-case designs via 'brms' and 'Stan'. Includes piecewise regression with random effects, posterior-based effect sizes, cross-case consistency estimates, support for AB, reversal, multiple baseline, multiple probe, alternating treatment, and changing criterion designs, two- to four-level hierarchical structures for single-study and meta-analytic data, and an interactive 'Shiny' interface for data upload, model specification, diagnostics, and export of reproducible scripts and reports.
